			<div class="content" id="post-content-2051470">
									

<p>As an aspiring writer, I find this to be extremely helpful to see how more experienced writers develop their ideas.</p>
<p>Like any art form, the writer eventually develops a distinct style that separates them from the rest. That is easy to see, because everyone has a different method to create their works, which is really cool.</p>
